flowchart TD

    %% Host Layer
    A[Windows 11 Host<br><br>- Podman Desktop<br>- Visual Studio<br>- IIS<br>- Windows SDKs<br><br>(Immutable Host / Hypervisor)]

    %% dev-box-vscode
    A --> B[dev-box-vscode Container<br><br>- Fedora base<br>- VS Code Server<br>- Git, shells, tooling<br>- Podman (inner)<br><br>(Canonical Workstation)]

    %% Inner Podman
    B --> C[Inner Podman Engine<br>(Runs all Dev Containers and Model Containers)]

    %% Dev Containers
    C --> D1[java-dev<br>(Java Dev Container)]
    C --> D2[dotnet-dev<br>(.NET Dev Container)]
    C --> D3[ai-sandbox-dev<br>(AI Sandbox Dev Container)]

    %% Model Containers under AI Sandbox
    D3 --> E1[ollama<br>(Model Container)]
    D3 --> E2[lmstudio<br>(Model Container)]
    D3 --> E3[openai-compatible servers<br>(Model Containers)]
